    <comment>Header for a per-color-scheme override of the profile setting of the same name.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="ColorScheme_AdjustIndistinguishableColors.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Whether text too close to its background is brightened or darkened whenever this scheme is in use. A value set on a profile itself still wins.</value>
