  </data>
  <data name="ColorScheme_AdjustIndistinguishableColorsInherit.Content" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Use the profile's setting</value>
    <comment>An option to choose from for the per-color-scheme "adjust indistinguishable colors" setting. The scheme states no value, so the profile decides.</comment>
  </data>
